      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MI AMIGO DIABLO (3) hit the frame latest (24.21) when second at Sale in a Free For All. Has already won two times from this draw. Looks suited and should go close. STAR NOTE (4) boasts a strong record this journey with four wins and six minors from 12 tries. Recorded a 1.75 lengths win (29.75) in a Special conditions G3 last time at The Meadows. Suited here and expected to run well. IMPRINT (2) stalked the lead from the inside draw then took over turning and burst clear to score (25.63) at Geelong in a Grade 5 over 460m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Will go close again if runs up to latest. MILLY LILY (8) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 515m.",
